$$
\begin{array}{c@{}c@{\;}c@{}c@{}c@{}c}
& & 4 & 3 & \diamond & 4_6\\
& & & \diamond & 2 & 5_6\\
&+ & & & 2 & \diamond_6\\
\cline{2-6}
& & 5 & 0 & \diamond & 3_6\\
\end{array}
$$

